# Build directories
build/
out/
third_party/*
build-*/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json
build.ninja
.ninja_*
*.elf
*.dis
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.bin
*.hex
*.map
*.log
*.out
.vscode/

# Sign-off evidence is the exception to `*.log`.
#
# A signed baseline ships a manifest that hashes its transcripts, so ignoring
# the transcripts commits a manifest referencing files a fresh checkout does
# not have — the artifact manifest becomes unverifiable and the "durable log"
# column of the sign-off record points at nothing.
!components/*/docs/signoff/**/*.log
.idea/
.cache/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
components/otp_tlm/otp_tlm
components/otp_tlm/*.o
components/otp_tlm/build/
*.yuv
output/

# Python bytecode caches. Tools under components/ and tools/ are run in place,
# so an import leaves one next to the source unless the interpreter is told not
# to; the screening tools set `dont_write_bytecode`, and this covers the rest.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
